    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERRUN PROTOCOL</strong> takes place in 2056, in a world where artificial intelligence has spiraled out of control. After your spaceship crashes on a mysterious island, you quickly discover that this place hides a dark secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing killer drones, armored units, and autonomous defense systems, you must explore the island, gather resources, and upgrade your equipment to survive. Use hacking to disable or hijack certain machines, access secure areas, and uncover the events that led to this catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Development Information</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is being developed in <strong>Unity</strong> using the <strong>Universal Render Pipeline (URP)</strong>.<br>Development has been ongoing for about <strong>7 months</strong> so far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generative AI</strong> has been used to help translate item descriptions and other in-game text into multiple languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>native French speaker</strong> who is also fluent in <strong>English</strong>, I can ensure the quality of these two languages. However, it's not possible for me alone to guarantee perfect quality in all the other languages offered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before the game\u2019s release, I\u2019d like to do a full review of all items and text with native speakers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in lending a hand, I\u2019d be delighted to collaborate with the community!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>OVERRUN PROTOCOL</strong> takes place in 2056, in a world where artificial intelligence has spiraled out of control. After your spaceship crashes on a mysterious island, you quickly discover that this place hides a dark secret.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Facing killer drones, armored units, and autonomous defense systems, you must explore the island, gather resources, and upgrade your equipment to survive. Use hacking to disable or hijack certain machines, access secure areas, and uncover the events that led to this catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Development Information</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project is being developed in <strong>Unity</strong> using the <strong>Universal Render Pipeline (URP)</strong>.<br>Development has been ongoing for about <strong>7 months</strong> so far.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Generative AI</strong> has been used to help translate item descriptions and other in-game text into multiple languages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a <strong>native French speaker</strong> who is also fluent in <strong>English</strong>, I can ensure the quality of these two languages. However, it's not possible for me alone to guarantee perfect quality in all the other languages offered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Before the game\u2019s release, I\u2019d like to do a full review of all items and text with native speakers.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you\u2019re interested in lending a hand, I\u2019d be delighted to collaborate with the community!</p>",
    "short_description": "OVERRUN PROTOCOL is a solo survival game where you face hostile machines on a mysterious island. Explore, hack systems, craft weapons, and uncover the secrets of an out-of-control AI. Your survival will depend on your ingenuity and adaptability.",
